<Track #implement-windows-sandbox-runner version="1" apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "completed" goal = "用 Zig 实现 Windows 原生沙箱 runner：RestrictedToken + capability SID + workspace ACL + WFP 网络过滤 + Elevated setup，SandboxBackendRuntime 的 restricted-token 分支真正 spawn runner。" description = "Windows 沙箱目前只有分级降级（disabled 直接执行 + 文件权限兜底），restricted-token 分支报 \"not implemented\"，elevated 缺真实 runner 二进制。用 Zig 0.16（PoC 已验证 CreateRestrictedToken 可调）实现两个原生 exe（runner + setup），提供真正进程级隔离。" question_mode = "decision-tree" question_severity = "auto" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-08-10T11:00:00Z" updated_at = "2026-08-10T18:00:00Z" gap_round = 1 } (
  <Ports { scope = "track" } [
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "behavior-deltas" domain = "behavior" path = "vfs://./behavior_deltas/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "state" name = "analysis" domain = "track" path = "vfs://./analysis/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "behavior" domain = "codument" path = "vfs://@/codument/behaviors/" }>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_implement-windows-sandbox-runner { name = "implement-windows-sandbox-runner" } (
    <Description ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8J>
    按 P1（Zig 骨架 + RestrictedToken + ACL）、P2（WFP + Elevated setup）、P3（Bun 集成）、P4（收口验证）顺序实施；每 phase TDD，终态 phase 跑 GapLoop 与 AttractorCheck。
    </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8J>
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "Zig 骨架 + RestrictedToken + ACL" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8K>
        创建 Zig 包（cell/packages/windows-sandbox-runner/），实现 token.zig（CreateRestrictedToken + capability SID）、acl.zig（workspace ACL + deny-write）、main.zig（参数解析 + 受限进程），build.zig 产出 runner exe。
        </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8K>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8M>
          zig build 产出 eidolon-windows-sandbox-runner.exe。
          </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8M>
