          受限进程无法写 workspace 外路径。
          </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8N>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8P>
          deny-write 对 .git/.eidolon 生效。
          </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8P>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T1.1" name = "Zig 包骨架 + build.zig" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8Q>
            创建 cell/packages/windows-sandbox-runner/ 目录：build.zig（Zig 0.16，产出 runner exe）、package.json（元数据+bin）、scripts/build.zig.ts（Bun 调 zig build）。
            </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8Q>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8R>
              zig build 产出 eidolon-windows-sandbox-runner.exe（可运行）。
              </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8R>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.2" name = "token.zig: CreateRestrictedToken + capability SID" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8S>
            实现 CreateRestrictedToken（flags=DISABLE_MAX_PRIVILEGE|LUA_TOKEN|WRITE_RESTRICTED）+ capability SID 生成（每个 workspace root 一个确定性 SID）+ restricting SIDs 组合。Zig 单测验证 token 创建成功且特权被禁用。
            </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8S>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8T>
              zig test 通过：RestrictedToken 创建成功，权限被限制。
              </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8T>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.3" name = "acl.zig: workspace ACL + deny-write" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8V>
            实现 workspace root 对 capability SID 授权写（--writable-root），.git/.eidolon 加 deny-write ACE（--deny-write），read-only 模式只授读。Zig 单测验证 ACL 生效。
            </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8V>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.3-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8W>
              zig test 通过：workspace root 对 capability SID 有写权，受保护目录有 deny-write。
              </?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8W>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.4" name = "main.zig: 参数解析 + 受限进程启动" status = "DONE" order = 3 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PT3GYZSYPPXDBCC2K8X>
            解析 --cwd/--mode/--network/--writable-root/--deny-write/-- &lt;shell&gt; /d /s /c &lt;command&gt;，构造受限令牌，CreateProcessAsUserW 启动命令，转发 stdio，等退出返回 exit code。
